WEBVTT

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:04.000
Hurry!!

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.540
So, what will you do?

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.880
We're not patient people.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:20.790
What do we do?

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.090
Fight?

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.200
Luna...

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.790
Are we going to let Pague be killed?

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.210
We can't do that.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.390
Then what can we do?

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.980
We abandon this spaceship.

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.160
What? But we would have had it fixed soon!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.190
But it wouldn't be in time.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.900
But we've worked so hard up to this point! I refuse!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.350
For a mechanic, it's results that are important.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:58.290
Whether you work hard or anything else, what's impossible is impossible.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:02.530
Get your mind working on what our best next move is instead.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:07.890
But if we hand this over to them, we won't be able to go home anymore!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.780
We steal their transport ship, right?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.160
Exactly.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:17.710
The transport ship should be locked down tightly...

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.750
...but me and my apprentice here will do something about that.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:23.680
Don't forget about me!

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.340
But we're right under their noses.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.910
How do we get out of here?

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.180
We lure them in, then trap them.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:34.700
If we do that, it should buy us enough time.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.800
And we can save Pague!

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.350
There's precious little time. Let's go with that.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:42.910
Wait a moment. Adam, is that okay with you?

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:51.730
This place is like your home, and there may still be clues about your family here somewhere.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:05.450
It's okay, because you're all with me.
You're all my family.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:06.840
Adam...

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:10.810
We need Adam's power for this plan to work.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.500
Will you help us?

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:17.830
Yeah, because I'm the one who put Pague in danger. I'll do my best!

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.830
There doesn't seem to be an entrance anywhere.

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.090
Hey, open the door!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.490
Or don't you care what happens to this guy?

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:34.590
Very well.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.080
We'll do as you say, so release Pague.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.960
Finally, they answer.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.360
Let's go.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:09.610
What?

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.130
There's nobody here, is there?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:14.260
Maybe they ran out the back door.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.850
No, there's no chance of that.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:21.910
Whoever they are, people can't escape that simply without leaving a trace.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.140
Then they're hiding somewhere around here?

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:26.080
Probably.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:29.080
I can't see anywhere that fits the bill, though.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.110
The Gyrostabilizer is more important than the brats.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.100
We can't afford for it to be damaged.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.890
I got what you're looking for right here.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.880
Adam, the next time they hit the wall, open the door.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.050
Now!

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:08.980
What's up with this room?

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.950
Maybe the Gyrostabilizer is in here.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.690
They might be hiding in there.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:17.490
Keep your guard up.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.290
How is it?

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:31.360
There's nobody here, and the circuit boards are all exposed.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.630
There's something still on.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.660
Okay, try pulling it out.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.280
Don't be too rough with it.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.040
This is too easy.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:45.610
Brindo isn't falling for the bait I left!

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.330
Okay, I've got it!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.600
Let me see it.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.330
Is it the Gyrostabilizer?

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.450
Close it!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.350
What's up with this? It's just scrap!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.590
What?

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.290
Crap! It was a trap!

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.450
Hurry outside!

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.100
Idiots!

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.280
Stay stuck in there like that!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.990
Adam, please.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.310
Pague!

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:52.740
I'm glad you're safe!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.280
Let's hurry.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.900
We're off to steal the transport ship!

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:57.650
Yes.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.130
I'll take Pague back to the valley.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:01.890
Go ahead without me.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:03.160
But Kaoru, what about you?

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.460
I'll catch up with you on the beach.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.680
Okay. Then please do.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.860
I guess it's farewell for a while.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.190
Don't let them catch you again.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:15.690
Okay?

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.230
C'mon, let's hurry.

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:27.540
It's no use.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.560
Move it. Let me try.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.890
We're all here, right?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.380
It's okay. We're all accounted for.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.080
Adam, are you tired?

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:09.910
No, I'm fine.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:11.490
Then let's go.

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:31.890
It still won't open?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:38.710
I'll probably be the one to break first.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:41.110
Don't give up. Keep going.

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:45.200
I know! I'd do that much without being told!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.210
Great, nicely done.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.700
But it looks like the front door is still closed.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.610
What did you say?

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.890
Don't worry.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.030
I'll take care of this one.

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.430
That's a miniature bomb!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:42.690
Why-- why didn't you use it sooner?

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:48.130
I only have the one. Plus, in a room with nowhere to hide, we'd be killed in the blast.

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.130
I don't even have the strength to be mad at you.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:59.710
Aren't we going to search for the Gyrostabilizer?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:03.910
If I were them, first thing after leaving here I'd steal the transport ship.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.400
I see. Which means the kids took it with them.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.700
What? Then we're screwed if we don't hurry, right?

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.660
Right, let's go.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.660
Kaoru!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:50.750
You're back early.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:53.640
If we don't hurry faster, they'll catch us!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:54.950
What did you say?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.610
They already escaped from the ruins?

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:00.460
They'll be finished climbing the waterfall soon.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:02.860
Let's hurry!

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.000
We're here.

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:44.450
Mr. Porte, how long do you think it will be before you can get the ship to fly?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:50.080
Let's see. It's a row boat, so twenty minutes to the transport ship.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.890
And twenty minutes to open the lock.

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:56.300
And twenty minutes to install the Gyrostabilizer.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.810
All told, about one hour.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:02.080
Kaoru, what do you think?

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:05.300
It'll be close. They might catch up with us.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.000
Then we'd better slow them down.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:12.160
In any event, there's a limit to the number of people who can ride the boat.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.830
I'll stay behind to help slow them down.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.180
Me too.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:20.940
I've no choice. This time for sure, I'll show them my skills with the bow.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:22.180
I'll stay behind as well.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:25.360
No, Kaoru, you go to the transport ship.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.130
There's nobody who can pilot the transport ship but you, Kaoru.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.000
Is that true?

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:36.200
Kaoru, please.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:39.130
Okay.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.290
I'll give it a shot.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.760
Then, all of you head to the transport ship.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:50.980
But if we separate from you, how will we contact you later?

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:54.010
It's okay, because I can talk to Luna.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:56.600
Exactly.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.450
Right, let's get to it!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:00.800
Yes!

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:05.860
Kaoru, Shingo, we're counting on you.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.910
Adam, make sure to contact me later.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.860
Let's go as well.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.430
There's nobody here after all.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:54.880
Damn them! When we catch them, I won't let them off easily!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.490
Then they really are on the beach. Let's hurry.

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.250
It's huge!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.510
Keep it up! Just a little further!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.510
I'll help too.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.050
Me too!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.010
I'm fine.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.580
Yeah, that's the spirit! Keep it up!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.690
I checked it out!

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:56.830
How was it?

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.760
As usual, it's set up just a little ahead of here.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.940
That monster plant.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:06.240
Then it looks like things can go according to plan.

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:11.640
Yeah. Using one monster to kill another was a great idea, Menori.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:15.580
Save the flattery, at least until it works.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.610
Believe in my archery skills as well!

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:21.130
Wherever they show up, it's be an easy victory!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:40.510
Give me the rope.

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:47.230
We're supposed to jump across at a place like that?

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.830
We have no choice but to jump, since we don't have a pier.

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:53.900
Okay, all ready. Now, come!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:55.780
Well, me first.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:03.090
Now, Adam.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.980
Calm down and jump, and you'll be fine.

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:11.640
Now!

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.740
Even I did it!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:18.540
Okay...

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:28.550
Kaoru, Adam, and Sharla, wait here.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.350
Come up when the door opens.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:31.440
Got it.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:10.890
As I expected, they changed the password for the door lock.

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.240
What do we do?

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:16.550
Chako, you have a GHC terminal, right?

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.440
You bet I do!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:24.200
Then I'll fix it so Chako can jack in!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.860
This is a delicate machine.

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:41.190
If you're too rough with it, it'll never open again. It's stubborn that way.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.810
Carefully... carefully...

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:47.940
By now, they've probably reached the transport ship.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:51.730
There's no way they'll be able to open that stubborn lock!

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.600
No, they have the geezer.

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:59.410
We thought little of them because they're kids, but if we don't watch out, they'll kill us in our sleep.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.930
What can they do?

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:07.480
We've already lost the laser gun, and they're trying to steal the transport ship.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.880
Just like Brindo says.

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:13.360
So? Do you have any sort of plan?

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.440
We'll read their actions as well.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:18.130
Their actions?

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:24.200
Yeah. If I were in their place, the first thing I'd do is set a trap to hold us back.

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:27.010
And get to the transport ship in the meantime.

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.560
A trap? Where?

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:33.240
They'll have figured out that we're heading to the beach.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.890
The route is a straight road.

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:38.600
Basically, there should be a trap set up ahead.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:40.290
I see.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.490
How is it? Still?

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:51.730
Gimme time! I'm lookin' into astronomical combinations!

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:55.590
I can't just attack it recklessly and expect it to work...

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.050
It worked!

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.730
It's open!

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:08.260
Let's go!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.130
Right.

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:20.900
That's a relief.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:27.760
Right, let's change the password so they can't come in, just in case they make it this far.

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:29.450
Aye aye, sir!

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:35.900
Password changed.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:37.700
Right, you're here.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:43.180
Then me, Shingo, and Chako will take care of repairs together.

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:46.510
Kaoru, take the pilot's seat.

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:50.530
Sharla and Adam, hide somewhere safe.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:51.540
Right!

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:12.350
They're late.

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:15.090
Yes, though I'd rather they didn't come at all.

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:16.740
That's impossible.

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:21.200
They should have realized we're trying to steal the transport ship.

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:22.330
That's true.

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:24.880
Don't tell me...

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:27.690
Everyone wait here!

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.830
Luna...

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:04.930
They got the better of us!

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:07.660
Those three are headed for the transport ship!

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:09.130
What'd you say?

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:10.330
Mr. Porte!

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:15.160
I know! Kaoru, start the engines so
we can take off as soon as possible.

00:23:15.390 --> 00:23:15.990
Aye-aye.

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:19.330
Hurry up and fly! Hurry or they'll catch you!

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:22.400
Everyone, good luck!

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:23.790
Good luck!

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:27.880
Next time: Begin surfacing
